You launch a mental assault on the target.

The assult increases the cooldown of any already cooling down talents by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], the duration of any magical, physical or mental detrimental effects by [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] (max 4x duration) and decreases the duration of any magical, physical or mental beneficial effects by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)].
